    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220530/extras/8b695f04395f3303c1932cda0edf6f01.avif?t=1730496020\" width=784 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first-person psychological horror game will have you checking over your shoulder every few seconds.\u00a0 You find yourself lost in a cursed forest from which no one ever returns. While driving at midnight, you\u2019re jolted by a distant, chilling scream\u2014a girl is in danger. Drawn to help, you find her locked in a cage, surrounded by mystery. To free her, you must locate seven hidden keys scattered throughout the eerie landscape, but only one will unlock her cage.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your flashlight is your only lifeline\u2014never turn it off. As you search through the oppressive darkness, a malevolent creature hunts you. Stealth won't save you\u2014it hears every movement. However, it\u2019s unnerved by your gaze, so always be ready to face it. Explore its haunted paths, uncover dark secrets, and gather the items you\u2019ll need to survive. But beware\u2014the more you discover, the more the forest will learn about you. The question is, will you uncover the truth before it discovers you?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220530/extras/8b695f04395f3303c1932cda0edf6f01.avif?t=1730496020\" width=784 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first-person psychological horror game will have you checking over your shoulder every few seconds.\u00a0 You find yourself lost in a cursed forest from which no one ever returns. While driving at midnight, you\u2019re jolted by a distant, chilling scream\u2014a girl is in danger. Drawn to help, you find her locked in a cage, surrounded by mystery. To free her, you must locate seven hidden keys scattered throughout the eerie landscape, but only one will unlock her cage.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your flashlight is your only lifeline\u2014never turn it off. As you search through the oppressive darkness, a malevolent creature hunts you. Stealth won't save you\u2014it hears every movement. However, it\u2019s unnerved by your gaze, so always be ready to face it. Explore its haunted paths, uncover dark secrets, and gather the items you\u2019ll need to survive. But beware\u2014the more you discover, the more the forest will learn about you. The question is, will you uncover the truth before it discovers you?</p>",
    "short_description": "In this first-person adventure/horror game, step into a forest where no one ever returns. Explore its haunted paths, uncover dark secrets, and gather the items you\u2019ll need to survive. But beware\u2014the more you discover, the more the forest will learn about you.",
